  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appui sanitaire d&#x2019;urgence &#xE0; la population vuln&#xE9;rable (r&#xE9;fugi&#xE9;s, retourn&#xE9;es, population h&#xF4;te) de la crise soudanaise vivant dans les provinces du Ouadda&#xEF;, Sila et le Lac.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this WHO project is to reduce morbidity and mortality among vulnerable populations (children under the age of five, pregnant women) in the Sudanese crisis. This project provides the purchase and distribution of medical-technical equipment and medications, as well as primary health care consultations, among other activities. The project provides life-saving assistance to 81,000 people, including 30,000 women, 22,000 children, and including 12,000 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
